title: Register_WrongChange_01_EN
---
Customer: Excuse me... I think you gave me too much change.

Player: Really?

Customer: Yes. I'm two dollars short on honesty, but two dollars over on cash.

-> Correct the change
    Player: Thanks for letting me know. Here's the correct change.
    Customer: Perfect. My conscience can rest again.
===

title: Register_WrongChange_02_EN
---
Customer: I think the change is wrong.

Player: Did the system mess up?

Customer: I don't know. But I have more money than when I walked in.

Player: ...That seems important.
===

title: Register_WrongChange_03_EN
---
Customer: Excuse me, you gave me an extra dollar.

Player: Thanks for telling me.

Customer: No problem. I already mentally spent the other nine.
===

title: Register_RandomJoke_01_EN
---
Customer: You know what's great about shopping here?

Player: What?

Customer: I always end up buying something I didn't need.
===

title: Register_RandomJoke_02_EN
---
Customer: Do you sell gift cards?

Player: Yes.

Customer: Perfect. Because I have no idea what to get my family.

Player: How about a gift card?

Customer: Exactly. How convenient.
===

title: Register_RandomJoke_03_EN
---
Customer: Do you know how long I've been standing in this line?

Player: No.

Customer: Me neither.

Customer: But I already feel like part of the family.
===
